spice
* NMOS Transistors
M1 3 1 4 4 NMOS
M2 2 2 4 4 NMOS

* Resistors
R1 3 6 25k
R2 2 6 25k
R3 4 7 20k

* Voltage Sources
V1 6 0 DC 5
V2 0 7 DC 5

* Current Sources
I1 3 0 DC
I2 2 0 DC
IS 4 0 DC

* Input Drivers
V1_1 1 0 DC v1
V2_1 2 0 DC v2

* .model statement for NMOS
.model NMOS NMOS (Level=1)

.end